{"id":"325347c189fac820","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-missingbits.md","title":"Missing bit samples, completions, and partial assignments","display":"df-missingbits — Missing bit samples, completions, and partial assignments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-missingbits","aliases":["27-df-missingbits"],"display":"df-missingbits — Missing bit samples, completions, and partial assignments","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.5; §12.5.1 before Example 12.20","source_printed_pages":"551–552","source_pdf_pages":"575–576","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-missingbits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-missingbits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-missingbits — Missing bit samples, completions, and partial assignments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.5; §12.5.1 before Example 12.20"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"551–552"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"575–576"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；布尔域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ast\\notin\\mathbb B\">\\(\\ast\\notin\\mathbb B\\)</span> 为固定新常元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F,S\">\\(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F,S\\)</span> 是下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb M^n\">\\(\\mathbb M^n\\)</span> 的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathbb M^n\">\\(X\\in\\mathbb M^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb M^n\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathbb M^n\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(X,i)\\in Q\\;(X_i=\\ast)\">\\(\\forall(X,i)\\in Q\\;(X_i=\\ast)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:Q\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\alpha:Q\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\ast\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\ast\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(X_i\\ne\\ast\\Rightarrow a_i=X_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(X_i\\ne\\ast\\Rightarrow a_i=X_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AS}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{(X,i)\\in S\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid X_i=\\ast\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AS}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{(X,i)\\in S\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid X_i=\\ast\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_i^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha(X,i)&amp;(X,i)\\in Q,\\\\X_i&amp;(X,i)\\notin Q,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq(X_i^{Q,\\alpha})_{i=1}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_i^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha(X,i)&amp;(X,i)\\in Q,\\\\X_i&amp;(X,i)\\notin Q,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq(X_i^{Q,\\alpha})_{i=1}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{X^{Q,\\alpha}\\mid X\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{X^{Q,\\alpha}\\mid X\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X^0\\coloneqq(X_i^0)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^0\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&amp;X_i\\ne\\ast,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^1\\coloneqq(X_i^1)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^1\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&amp;X_i\\ne\\ast.\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X^0\\coloneqq(X_i^0)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^0\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&amp;X_i\\ne\\ast,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^1\\coloneqq(X_i^1)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^1\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&amp;X_i\\ne\\ast.\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§12.5 及 §12.5.1，印刷页 551–552 / PDF 第 575–576 页；完成立方体 C_n(X) 是把“所有缺失位取 0 或 1”内建为集合的局部记号。AS 的键为样本模式 X 与坐标 i，而非仅坐标 i；不同模式的缺失位可独立赋值。若同一模式同时属于正、负样本，键仍是同一个 X，因此这两标签共享其缺失位赋值。未强制两样本集不相交，与原书 pBmb 定义一致。分段互斥覆盖，且 Q 的每个位置均为缺失位，保证只替换缺失位。Q 可以同时包含其他样本的缺失位；同一 α 因而可分别用于正、负样本子集。若 AS(S)⊆Q，则 S<sup>{Q,α}⊆B</sup>n。陈述与赋值规则已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；布尔域 $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。$\\ast\\notin\\mathbb B$ 为固定新常元，$\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F,S$ 是下式中 $\\mathbb M^n$ 的子集，$X\\in\\mathbb M^n$，$Q\\subseteq\\mathbb M^n\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$\\forall(X,i)\\in Q\\;(X_i=\\ast)$，$\\alpha:Q\\to\\mathbb B$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ast\\notin\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb M^n","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathbb M^n","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb M^n\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(X,i)\\in Q\\;(X_i=\\ast)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:Q\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\ast\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb M^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(X_i\\ne\\ast\\Rightarrow a_i=X_i)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AS}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{(X,i)\\in S\\times\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid X_i=\\ast\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X_i^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha(X,i)&(X,i)\\in Q,\\\\X_i&(X,i)\\notin Q,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq(X_i^{Q,\\alpha})_{i=1}^n.","display":true},{"tex":"S^{Q,\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{X^{Q,\\alpha}\\mid X\\in S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X^0\\coloneqq(X_i^0)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^0\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&X_i\\ne\\ast,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad X^1\\coloneqq(X_i^1)_{i=1}^n,\\quad X_i^1\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&X_i=\\ast,\\\\X_i&X_i\\ne\\ast.\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true}],"bytes":2596,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；完成立方体、赋值及样本变换见 [[27-df-missingbits]]，全函数扩张见 [[27-df-extension]]。记 $A=\\mathrm{AS}_n(\\widetilde T\\cup\\widetilde F)$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-missingbits|df-missingbits — Missing bit samples, completions, and partial assignments]]"},{"id":"f1791ff3e14b4575","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可追踪的内部入口依次为 [[27-df-functionalequation]] 与 [[27-df-equationalclass]]，[[27-df-fiterror]] 与 [[27-df-bestfit]]，[[27-df-missingbits]] 与 [[27-df-missingextensions]]，以及 [[27-df-pbextension]]、[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]。它们的完整数学条件仍由各自的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 给出，本摘要不增加新的数学前提。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}